{"schemaVersion":"kfc_portal_schema_v1","generatedAt":"2026-08-25T15:50:18.527459+00:00","type":"news","id":"news_58aeaa4e197324eb17ac","item":{"id":"news_58aeaa4e197324eb17ac","type":"news","title":"1932年俄亥俄州工人失业后，花12年建造了一座岩石花园","sourceId":"timesofindia.indiatimes.com","status":"new","publishedAt":"2026-08-25T20:52:19","updatedAt":"2026-08-25T14:24:45.595547Z","summary":"工厂失业后，哈里·哈特曼将热情倾注于一座令人叹为观止的民间艺术花园，用超过25万块石头和回收材料打造。53年来，他的妻子玛丽悉心照料这片梦幻之地，直至科勒基金会修缮后移交给当地非营利组织。花园现已成为对公众开放的美丽景点，展现着哈里非凡的创意。","articleId":"","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1932-an-ohio-foundry-worker-lost-his-job-and-began-building-a-rock-garden-he-spent-12-years-creating-hundreds-of-structures-and-his-wife-preserved-it-for-another-53-years/articleshow/133510533.cms"}}